<!DOCTYPE html><html lang="en-US"><head><meta charset="utf-8"><script nonce="n1">var DOCS_timing={}; DOCS_timing['sl']=new Date().getTime();</script><title>Andrew Luxem</title></head><body><img src="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/sitesv/IMG000=w400" alt=""><p>This archived page has enough ordinary paragraph text to read as a normal static document. It talks about marketing systems, lifecycle programs and a few side projects, and it is long enough that the visible-text heuristic does not fire on it.</p><script nonce="n1">AF_initDataCallback({key: 'ds:1', data:[["https:\/\/lh3.googleusercontent.com\/sitesv\/DDD444=w1280"],["https:\/\/lh3.googleusercontent.com\/sitesv\/EEE555=w1280"]]});</script></body></html>
